 # Project rules
 
 This project declares no rules beyond its README.
+
+## Decisions taken
+
+- Cancellation refund (`cancel(bookingId, at)`): the full booking total if `at` is at or before the
+  booking's start, nothing once it has started. A booking can be cancelled only once, and a cancelled
+  booking no longer holds its equipment. Approved by the project owner.
